<SUMMARY>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
SUMMARY: 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
This proposed rule would amend the Lewiston, Idaho, Class E airspace. This action is necessary to accommodate arrival/departure
aircraft transitioning between the en route and terminal areas in southwestern Idaho. Airspace reclassification,
in effect as of September 16, 1993, has discontinued the use of the term ``transition area,'' replacing it with the
designation ``Class E airspace.'' the area would be depicted on aeronautical charts.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 02 -->
