<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 This safety and security zone will be in effect at various times to be published in the Coast Guard Local Notice to Mariners
or broadcasted via Marine Radio VHF&hyph;FM Channels 16 &amp; 22. These times will include the actual effective time
and date and the termination time and date.
