<SUMMARY>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
SUMMARY:
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 The Patent and Trademark Office (PTO) is proposing 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
to amend the rules of practice in patent cases, Part 1 of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
title 37, Code of Federal Regulations, to adjust certain 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
patent fee amounts to reflect fluctuations in the Consumer 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Price Index (CPI) and to recover costs of operation. No 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
trademark fees will be affected by this rulemaking. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

