<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Federalism implications affecting the relationship between 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the National Government and the States as outlined in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Executive Order 12612. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
