<SUMMARY>
<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=2 -->
SUMMARY:
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
 We are proposing to revise the Medicare hospital 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
inpatient prospective payment systems for operating costs 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and capital-related costs to implement necessary changes 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
arising from our continuing experience with the system. In 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
addition, in the addendum to this proposed rule, we are 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
describing proposed changes in the amounts and factors 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
necessary to determine prospective payment rates for 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Medicare hospital inpatient services for operating costs and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
capital-related costs. These changes would be applicable to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
discharges occurring on or after October 1, 1994. We are 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
also setting proposed rate-of-increase limits for hospitals 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and hospital units excluded from the prospective payment 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
systems. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 02 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
