<PARENT> FR940527-1-00014 </PARENT>
<TEXT>
 
<!-- PJG STAG 4702 -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
&bull;Specific adjustment for taxes to the capital 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
prospective payment system federal rate. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&bull;Revision of provision relating to exceptions 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
payments. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&bull;Extraordinary circumstances exceptions payments. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&bull;Funding of depreciation. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=81 g=1 f=1 -->
5. Changes for Hospitals Excluded from the Prospective 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Payment System 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
In section VI of this preamble, we discuss changes to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the regulations at 42 CFR parts 412 and 413 for hospitals 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and hospital units excluded from the prospective payment 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
system. The proposed changes concern the following: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&bull;New requirements for certain long-term care 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
hospitals excluded from the prospective payment systems. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&bull;Removal of the 1986 malpractice rule. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&bull;Related technical changes. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=81 g=1 f=1 -->
6. Determining Prospective Payment Rates and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Rate-of-Increase Limits 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
In the addendum to this proposed rule, we set forth 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
proposed changes to the amounts and factors for determining 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the FY 1995 prospective payment rates for operating costs 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and capital-related costs. We are also proposing new update 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
factors for determining the rate-of-increase limits for cost 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
reporting periods beginning in FY 1995 for hospitals and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
hospital units excluded from the prospective payment system. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=81 g=1 f=1 -->
7. Impact Analysis 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
In Appendix A, we set forth an analysis of the impact 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
that the proposed changes described in this rule would have 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
on affected entities. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=81 g=1 f=1 -->
8. Capital Acquisition Model 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Appendix B contains the technical appendix on the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
proposed FY 1995 capital acquisition model and budget 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
neutrality adjustment. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=81 g=1 f=1 -->
9. Report to Congress on the Update Factor for Prospective 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Payment Hospitals and Hospitals Excluded from the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Prospective Payment System 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Section 1886(e)(3)(B) of the Act requires that the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Secretary report to Congress no later than March 1, 1994 on 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
our initial estimate of an update factor for FY 1995 for 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
both prospective payment hospitals and hospitals excluded 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
from the prospective payment system. This report is 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
included as Appendix C to this proposed rule. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=81 g=1 f=1 -->
10. Proposed Recommendation of Update Factor for Hospital 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Inpatient Operating Costs 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
As required by sections 1886 (e)(4) and (e)(5) of the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Act, Appendix D provides our recommendation of the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
appropriate percentage change for FY 1995 for the following: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&bull;Large urban, other urban, and rural average 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
standardized amounts (and hospital-specific rates applicable 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
to sole community hospitals) for hospital inpatient services 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
paid for under the prospective payment system for operating 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
costs. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&bull;Target rate-of-increase limits to the allowable 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
operating costs of hospital inpatient services furnished by 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
hospitals and hospital units excluded from the prospective 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
payment system. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=81 g=1 f=1 -->
11. Framework for Capital Update 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
In Appendix E, we are setting forth a preliminary 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
framework for developing the annual update factor for 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
inpatient hospital capital-related costs. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=81 g=1 f=1 -->
12. Discussion of Prospective Payment Assessment Commission 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Recommendations 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
The Prospective Payment Assessment Commission (ProPAC) 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
is directed by section 1886(e)(2)(A) of the Act to make 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
recommendations on the appropriate percentage change factor 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
to be used in updating the average standardized amounts. In 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
addition, section 1886(e)(2)(B) of the Act directs ProPAC to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
make recommendations regarding changes in each of the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Medicare payment policies under which payments to an 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
institution are prospectively determined. In particular, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the recommendations relating to the hospital inpatient 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
prospective payment systems are to include recommendations 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
concerning the number of DRGs used to classify patients, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
adjustments to the DRGs to reflect severity of illness, and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
changes in the methods under which hospitals are paid for 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
capital-related costs. Under section 1886(e)(3)(A) of the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Act, the recommendations required of ProPAC under sections 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
1886(e)(2) (A) and (B) of the Act are to be reported to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Congress not later than March 1 of each year. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
We are printing ProPAC's March 1, 1994 report, which 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
includes its recommendations, as Appendix F of this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
document. The recommendations, and the actions we are 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
proposing to take with regard to them (when an action is 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
recommended), are discussed in detail in the appropriate 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
sections of this preamble, the addendum, or the appendices 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
to this proposed rule. See section VII of this preamble for 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
specific information concerning where individual 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
recommendations are addressed. For a brief summary of the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
ProPAC recommendations, we refer the reader to the beginning 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
of the ProPAC report as set forth in Appendix F of this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
proposed rule. ProPAC also produced technical appendices in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
its March 1, 1994 report that provide background material 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and detailed analyses used in preparation of the ProPAC 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
recommendations. For further information relating 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
specifically to the ProPAC report or to obtain a copy of the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
technical appendices, contact ProPAC at (202) 401&hyph;8986.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

