<!-- PJG ITAG l=81 g=1 f=1 -->
3. HCFA Hospital Wage Index Data 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
This tape contains four files. Included are: (1) the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
hospital hours and salaries for FY 1991 used to create the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
proposed FY 1995 prospective payment system wage indexes; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(2) a history of all wage indexes used since October 1, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
1983; (3) a list of State and county codes used by SSA and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
FIPS (Federal Information Processing Standards), county 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
name, and Metropolitan Statistical Area (MSA); and (4) a 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
file of hospitals that were reclassified for the purpose of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the FY 1995 wage index. Two versions of these files are 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
created each year. They support the following: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&bull;NPRM published in the 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=4 -->
Federal Register
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
, usually by the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
end of May. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
&bull;Final Rule published in the 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=4 -->
Federal Register
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
, usually 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
by the first week of September. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 02 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=15 g=1 f=1 -->
