File cost: $500.00 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Periods available: FY 1995 PPS Update 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 02 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
We note that the files also are available individually 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
as indicated below. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) HCFA Hospital Wage Index Survey Only (usually 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
