<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(2) Urban and Rural Wage Indices Only 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(3) PPS SSA/FIPS MSA State and County 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Crosswalk Only (usually available by the end 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
