This file contains data used to estimate payments under Medicare's hospital inpatient prospective payment systems
for operating and capital-related costs. The data are taken from various sources, including the Provider-Specific
File, the PPS-VI and PPS-VII Minimum Data Sets, and prior impact files. The data set is abstracted from an internal
file used for the impact analysis of the changes to the prospective payment systems published in the 
