<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
This diskette contains data used to develop the DRG relative weights. It contains mean, maximum, minimum, standard
deviation and coefficient of variation statistics by DRG for length of stay and standardized charges. The BOR tables
are ``Before Outliers Removed'' and the AOR is ``After Outliers Removed.'' (Outliers refers to statistical outliers,
not payment outliers.) 
