<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Definitions. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
As used in this section_
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Average age of fixed assets. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
The average age of fixed assets is the ratio of accumulated depreciation for buildings and fixed equipment to current
depreciation expense for buildings and fixed equipment. The average age of fixed assets is determined from information
on the Medicare cost report. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Current ratio. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Current ratio means the ratio of current liabilities to current assets. The current ratio is determined from information
on the Medicare cost report.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Fixed assets. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Fixed assets mean buildings and fixed equipment. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(b) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Criterion for additional payment during the transition period. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
An additional payment is made to a hospital paid under either the fully prospective payment methodology or the hold-harmless
payment methodology as determined under paragraph (c) of this section for cost reporting periods beginning on or
after October 1, 1991 and before October 1, 2001. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

