<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=4 -->
We did not have data for 24 hospitals, and had to drop them from the capital analysis. Most of these dropped hospitals
are new hospitals or hospitals with very few Medicare admissions. This leaves us with 5224 hospitals and should not
affect the precision of the budget neutrality determination. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

