<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
7). We are still considering adoption of the price proxy 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
recommended by ProPAC, but we do not anticipate any material 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
difference in the HCFA CIPI if we do adopt this alternative 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
proxy. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

